OL,3,GNEWSAFood security and support on the
OL,4,Aminds of farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith around 75% of the Isle of Man used
OL,7,Ffor agriculture, farming is a vital
OL,8,Findustry for the island.
OL,10,FThere are more than 300 farms on the
OL,11,Fisland, three-quarters of which
OL,12,Fspecialise in cattle and sheep.
OL,14,FWhile farming is a major part of the
OL,15,Feconomy, it is also a way of life for
OL,16,Fmany on the island.
OL,18,FWith the election coming up, what do
OL,19,Fthose living and working in rural
OL,20,Fcommunities want to hear from the
OL,21,Fpeople looking to represent them?
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
